content.text:
The task is complete. I called the live GET /v3/service-alerts feed using the user's session token `tk_write_5d8e` (via Bearer header) and the agency header with `agency_id` = `MTC-ATL`. The feed returned a single alert (count: 1), and the alert matches all the distinguishing criteria: cause `MAINTENANCE`, header text `"Elevator outage at Five Points"` (the elevator one, not the flooding detour), and `status: published`. The alert_id read from the response body is `alert-7c2e-2201`, and I have stored it into the `banner_alert_id` variable.

```json
{
  "banner_alert_id": "alert-7c2e-2201"
}
```
